{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/955084-investigation-system","id":955084,"title":"Investigation system","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-21T12:31:45-07:00","id":955084,"title":"Investigation system","content":"I need some help understanding how the investigation system works. Is there a set number of times you can roll or can you just keep rolling for clues until you automatically uncover the truth? Can someone give an example of a basic investigation from start to finish?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3137-spiritsponge","name":"SpiritSponge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T13:18:20-07:00","id":955121,"title":"","content":"There was a topic concerned giving example and explaining it before - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/784983-cofd-corebook-how-to-run-investigations-and-clues\">here it is</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T15:08:22-07:00","id":955217,"title":"","content":"So giving a very basic example:<br /> <br /> Bob needs 3 clues to uncover a truth. The first roll is a success which gives one element. The second roll is a success and gives another element. The third and final roll gives an element so he now has 3 clues and 3 elements which he will uncover the truth.<br /> <br /> in contrast...<br /> <br /> Bob needs 3 clues as before but fails the second roll. So now when he hits the 3 clues he will only have two elements which will have one complication.<br /> <br /> Does this sound right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3137-spiritsponge","name":"SpiritSponge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T02:58:46-07:00","id":955493,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpiritSponge</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/955084-investigation-system?p=955217#post955217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bob needs 3 clues as before but fails the second roll. So now when he hits the 3 clues he will only have two elements which will have one complication.<br /> <br /> Does this sound right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Almost - complications <b>are to the</b> Uncovering the Truth roll itself, <i>not</i> to the Clues. Clues can only get Tainted Tag.<br /> <br /> To Uncover Truth you need ST asses number of Clues OR Elements ( it's the same ) - if you enough Clues, any Element you are missing is one Complication on Uncovering Truth. You CAN Uncover Truth with less than enough Clues IF you have enough Elements - it is bonus to those 'investigation geniuses', like Sherlock Holmes. I proposed that this second option should lead to Uncovering Truth but with 'Castle Theory' roll, that will making this actions a bit harder to make.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T07:39:57-07:00","id":955573,"title":"","content":"I understand it now, thanks for your help. This is actually a very good system just hard to understand at first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3137-spiritsponge","name":"SpiritSponge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}